## Upstream project

This is an independent TypeScript implementation inspired by Alex Shovkoplyas, VE3NEA's MorseRunner. The upstream project is available under MPL-2.0:

https://github.com/VE3NEA/MorseRunner

No source code from the upstream repository is included in or bundled with this project.

## Community Edition features

Contest-mode compatibility and call-history import behavior were designed for files used by MorseRunner Community Edition. No Community Edition source or user data is redistributed here.

## Runtime user data

Users may import files such as `MASTER.DTA` and N1MM-style call histories. These files remain in the user's browser, are not part of this repository, and remain the responsibility of the user.

